// std.testing: helpers for `test` blocks. `allocator` is built into the
// compiler, because it is the allocator of the running test:
//
//     std.testing.allocator() Allocator
//
// It is the leak-checked debug allocator that `@testAllocator()` also
// gives: a leak or a double free fails the test. Like `@testAllocator()`,
// it can be used only in a `test` block; pass it to other functions.
